; vtcon install: copies the handler and mounts XCON:.
; Run from the unpacked drawer:  Execute Install
FailAt 21
Copy vtcon-handler L: CLONE
Copy XCON DEVS:DOSDrivers/XCON CLONE
MakeDir >NIL: ENVARC:terminfo
MakeDir >NIL: ENVARC:terminfo/v
Copy terminfo/v/vtcon ENVARC:terminfo/v/vtcon CLONE
Copy termcap.vtcon ENVARC:termcap.vtcon CLONE
Mount >NIL: XCON: FROM DEVS:DOSDrivers/XCON
Echo "vtcon installed. Try:  NewShell XCON:0/20/640/300/vtcon/CLOSE"
Echo "For ixemul programs:  SetEnv TERM vtcon"
